    "text": "<p>Four identical rectangular plates with length, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and breadth, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> are arranged as shown in figure. The equivalent capacitance between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is _______.</p><p>(Round off to the Nearest Integer)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/65bd1939-6cea-4e12-9039-d7aa9a1b497d-image.png\" style=\"width: 214px; height: 215px;\" /></p>",
